### Step 1 – Submit prompt
POST http://localhost:5678/webhook-test/hitl-pattern
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "List the Baltic countries along with their capitals and populations. Calculate the total combined population across all three."
}

> {%
    client.global.set("resume_url", response.body.resume_url);
%}

### Step 2 – Approve
POST {{resume_url}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "Approve"
}

### Step 2 – Reject
POST {{resume_url}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "reject",
  "feedback": "Include any relevant references used."
}
